      <p source="#source-708-1268"><seg source="#source-708-768">十日御認の御書、十一日ニ相達拝見仕候。段</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-768-801">〻</g><seg source="#source-801-813">の御思召</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-813-837"><rb>能</rb><rt>（よく）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-837-900">相わかり申候。そが中ニも蝦夷の一条は別して</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-900-927"><rb>兼而</rb><rt>（かねて）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-927-990">存込の事故、元より御同意仕候。別紙二通此度</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-996-1056"><seg source="#source-990-996">愛進</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-1020-1041">（沢村惣之丞）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-1056-1086">ニさし送り申候間、内</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-1086-1119">〻</g><seg source="#source-1119-1164">御一覧の上、其上を封じ御送り可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1164-1176">レ</note><seg source="#source-1176-1179">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1179-1191">レ</note><seg source="#source-1191-1245">成、然レバ愛進より何ぞ申出候べしと奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1245-1257">レ</note><seg source="#source-1257-1268">存候。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1268-1414"><seg source="#source-1268-1283">其上御考可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1283-1295">レ</note><seg source="#source-1295-1298">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1298-1310">レ</note><seg source="#source-1310-1355">成、私儀もひまを得候へバ下坂可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1355-1367">レ</note><seg source="#source-1367-1391">仕、外に用向も在</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1391-1403">レ</note><seg source="#source-1403-1414">之候。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1414-1650"><seg source="#source-1414-1417">○</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1417-1438"><rb>扨</rb><rt>（さて）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1438-1474">、今朝永井玄蕃方ニ参り色</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-1474-1507">〻</g><seg source="#source-1507-1537">談じ候所、天下の事ハ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1537-1573"><rb>危共</rb><rt>（あやふしとも）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1573-1612">、御気の毒とも言葉に尽し不</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1612-1624">レ</note><seg source="#source-1624-1627">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1627-1639">レ</note><seg source="#source-1639-1650">申候。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1650-1913"><seg source="#source-1650-1701">大兄御事も今しバらく命を御大事ニ被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1701-1713">レ</note><seg source="#source-1713-1728">成度、実ハ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1728-1773"><rb><seg source="#source-1731-1734">可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1734-1746">レ</note><seg source="#source-1746-1749">為</seg></rb><rt>（なすべき）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1773-1863">の時ハ今ニて御座候。やがて方向を定め、シユラか極楽かに御供可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1863-1875">レ</note><seg source="#source-1875-1881">申奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1881-1893">レ</note><seg source="#source-1893-1913">存候。謹言。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-1913-1936"><seg source="#source-1913-1936">十一月十一日</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1936-1962" style="padding-inline-end: 0em; text-align: right">
        <p source="#source-1954-1962"><seg source="#source-1954-1962">龍馬</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1962-2118" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-1983-2118"><seg source="#source-1983-2001">追白、彼玄蕃</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2001-2049"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-24" source="#source-2004-2031">ヿ</g></rb><rt>（こと）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2049-2082">ハヒタ同心ニて候、再拝</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-2082-2115">〻</g><seg source="#source-2115-2118">。</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
